					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 742510101,
					"content": "Many thanks for the invitation, Miss Guillotin. I presume this pure water was prepared specially for me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510102,
					"content": "Think nothing of it, Monsieur Neuvillette. It's an honor to have the Iudex of Fontaine take time out of his busy schedule to join me for a cup of... water.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510103,
					"content": "Does the Fatui have some official business that you wish to discuss?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510104,
					"content": "Not at all. This is a strictly personal visit. And there's no need to be so formal. I simply wanted to ask you about an old acquaintance.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510105,
					"content": "An old acquaintance... Ah, you must be talking about Mr. Alain Guillotin? The great Lord-Artificer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510106,
					"content": "Exactly. What kind of person was he? I heard he was your subordinate in his youth.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510107,
					"content": "Hmm...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510108,
					"content": "Mr. Guillotin was an earnest and grounded young man. Even after being granted the title of White Cavalier of Protection, he never exhibited one iota of arrogance.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510109,
					"content": "He spent most of his time studying machines. The world outside his own little bubble was of little interest to him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510110,
					"content": "Huh... So he was like that even when he was younger? I wonder if he was wise beyond his years or simply ignorant of the ways of the world.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510111,
					"content": "However... He changed dramatically after losing his family and friends.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510112,
					"content": "The Tower of Gestalt? And Elynas...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510113,
					"content": "Indeed. When he and I signed the order to search the tower, he appeared... helpless.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510114,
					"content": "It was the estrangement and alienation of the past that led to all that. He must have felt guilty, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510115,
					"content": "Hmm... He became even more taciturn after that, and our interactions grew less frequent.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510116,
					"content": "At the ceremony where he was given the title of Lord-Artificer, all he said was the following:",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510117,
					"content": "\"A quiet, humble life is a surer path to happiness than the blind pursuit of endless perfection.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510118,
					"content": "Heh... And that's exactly how he lived in his later years.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510119,
					"content": "I guess he wasn't just saying that to the crowd. He was saying it to himself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510120,
					"content": "And what do you think about it all, Miss Guillotin?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510121,
					"content": "Me? Hmph. I won't pass judgment on his epiphany or his way of life, just as he never told me how I should live my own.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510122,
					"content": "But I have no intention of either following his path or of imitating his ideals. I'm my own person.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510123,
					"content": "Heh... Thank you. You've helped me understand him better.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						742510124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 742510124,
					"content": "You're very welcome. It's a pleasure to share stories of the past with one of his family.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Neuvillette"
				}
			]
		},
